SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the source code in this repository, which contains two
independent projects:

  * the MATLAB preprocessing / feature-extraction pipeline at the repository
    root, and
  * the strawberry disease detector under plant_ai/ (YOLOv5 classification,
    FastAPI backend, React frontend).

NOT covered by this licence, and NOT redistributable:

  * Image datasets. The largest upstream source declares no licence at all and
    two further sources are non-commercial with share-alike obligations, so no
    composite licence can be granted. See "Data licensing" in
    plant_ai/README.md.
  * Trained model weights (plant_ai/backend/best.pt).

Third-party components retain their own licences. ultralytics/yolov5 is
AGPL-3.0; the vendored clone under plant_ai/yolov5/ is not committed to this
repository but is fetched separately and retains that licence.
